    <Placemark>
      <name>Joyville Vyomora</name>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <p>Premium large-format residential community spread across 25 acres in Hinjawadi, Pune by Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate. Spacious flats and duplexes from 685 sq. ft. to 1434 sq. ft., minutes from Hinjewadi Phase 1, Rajiv Gandhi Infotech Park, and the Mumbai-Pune Expressway.</p>
        <p><a href="https://joyville-homes.com/projects/joyville-vyomora-hinjewadi">View Project</a></p>
      ]]></description>
