      <name>Joyville Sensorium</name>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <p>Experience the pinnacle of sky-luxe living at Joyville Sensorium by Shapoorji Pallonji. A premier residential project in Hinjewadi Phase 1 offering sprawling biophilic green spaces, high-liquidity investment potential, and over 60 majestic amenities near the Rajiv Gandhi Infotech Park.</p>
        <p><a href="https://joyville-homes.com/projects/joyville-sensorium-hinjewadi">View Project</a></p>
      ]]></description>
