    <Placemark>
      <name>Shapoorji Pallonji Treetopia</name>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <p>Nestled between hills on three sides in Jadhavwadi within the Pune Growth Corridor, Treetopia is a ~105-acre serene valley of growth by Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate. Offering premium NA residential villa plots from 1,800 to 5,000+ sq. ft. centred around a 25-acre natural lake, just 10 minutes from the proposed Purandar Airport with clear title individual 7/12 extract documentation.</p>
        <p><a href="https://joyville-homes.com/projects/shapoorji-treetopia-pune">View Project</a></p>
      ]]></description>
